  "name": "Legendary Pokémon Present Campaign",
  "category": "campaign",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Legendary Pokémon Present Campaign (ポケモンカードゲーム 伝説ポケモンプレゼント) was a draw in summer 2010: two barcodes from booster packs of the DP, DPt or LEGEND series made one entry, postmarked between 21 July and 6 September 2010. Course A was a set of six shiny Pokémon, Dialga, Palkia, Deoxys, Kyogre, Groudon and Rayquaza, and course B a complete set of the nine LEGEND Pokémon cards, each for 5,000 winners, 10,000 in all. The six course A cards were later printed in English in Call of Legends, with SL numbers.",
